#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Charlotte keeps the "
"firm running, from client scheduling to the details that make sure nothing "
"falls through the cracks. She's often the first person a new client speaks "
"to."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Charlotte mantiene "
"el bufete en funcionamiento, desde la coordinación de citas con clientes "
"hasta los detalles que garantizan que nada quede pendiente. A menudo es la "
"primera persona con la que habla un nuevo cliente."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Confidentiality<br/"
">\n"
"                                                        &amp;amp; Trust"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Confidencialidad<br/>"
"\n"
"                                                        y confianza"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Edward is Richard "
"Whitemore's son and Edward Whitemore Sr.'s grandson. He took over the firm's "
"leadership in 2009 and has spent his career advising local business owners "
"on the decisions that shape their companies. He still takes on client "
"matters personally, alongside guiding the firm's next generation."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Edward es hijo de "
"Richard Whitemore y nieto de Edward Whitemore Sr. Asumió el liderazgo del "
"bufete en 2009 y ha dedicado su carrera a asesorar a empresarios locales en "
"las decisiones que dan forma a sus empresas y negocios. Sigue atendiendo "
"personalmente los asuntos de sus clientes, a la vez que guía a la siguiente "
"generación del bufete."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Expertise&amp;nbsp;"
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        &amp;amp; Experience"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        "
"Experiencia&amp;nbsp;<br/>\n"
"                                                        y trayectoria"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Isabelle advises the "
"firm on employment law and business disputes, drawing on twenty years of "
"experience before joining Whitemore &amp;amp; Sons in 2020. She works "
"closely with the firm's partners on matters that call for a second, more "
"senior opinion."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Isabelle asesora al "
"bufete en derecho laboral y litigios comerciales. Antes de incorporarse a "
"Whitemore &amp;amp; Sons en 2020, acumuló veinte años de experiencia. "
"Trabaja en estrecha colaboración con los socios del bufete en asuntos que "
"requieren una segunda opinión con mayor experiencia."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Julian works across "
"the firm's contract and corporate governance matters, supporting clients "
"from first engagement through closing. He's known for being the person "
"clients can always reach with a quick question."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Julian trabaja en "
"asuntos contractuales y de governanza del bufete, y acompaña a los clientes "
"desde el primer contacto hasta el cierre. Se le conoce por ser la persona a "
"la que los clientes siempre pueden acudir para resolver una duda rápida."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Margaret leads the "
"firm's corporate and transactional practice, advising clients on formation, "
"contracts, and mergers and acquisitions. She joined the firm in 2015 after "
"seven years at a larger Brussels firm, and now leads much of the firm's day "
"to day client work."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Margaret dirige el "
"área de derecho corporativo y operaciones del bufete. Asesora a los clientes "
"sobre constitución de empresas, contratos, fusiones y adquisiciones. Se "
"incorporó al bufete en 2015, tras siete años en un bufete más grande de "
"Bruselas, y ahora dirige gran parte del trabajo diario con los clientes."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Personalized&amp;nbsp;"
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Service"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        "
"Servicio&amp;nbsp;<br/>\n"
"                                                        personalizado"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Thomas handles the "
"firm's mergers and acquisitions and corporate governance matters, working "
"closely with Margaret on the firm's larger transactions. He joined the firm "
"in 2017 and is known for staying on a deal through the smallest details, "
"right up to closing."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Thomas se ocupa de "
"las fusiones y adquisiciones y los asuntos de gobernanza del bufete. Trabaja "
"en estrecha colaboración con Margaret en las operaciones más grandes. Se "
"incorporó al bufete en 2017 y se distingue por seguir cada operación hasta "
"el más mínimo detalle, hasta su cierre."

